 "notes": [
  "Starting cards as posted under 'start (8)': Agents Of Black Sun / Vengeance Of The Dark Prince, Coruscant, Coruscant: Imperial City, Prince Xizor, Prepared Defenses, Imperial Arrest Order, Crush The Rebellion, There Is No Try & Oppressive Enforcement; they count toward the 60.",
  "Several Effects start (Imperial Arrest Order, Crush The Rebellion, There Is No Try & Oppressive Enforcement); none is named as the starting Effect, so none is shown as one.",
  "Prince Xizor is listed both in the starting section and under Characters; both are counted. The section headers say 18 characters and 15 interrupts; the strategy's revision says 17 characters and 16 interrupts, which matches the list. Total is 60 as published.",
  "Secret Plans, No Escape and There Is No Try & Oppressive Enforcement are 2001 Effects (not Defensive Shields).",
  "Posted 'Coruscant' and 'Coruscant DB' dested the Dark Special Edition Coruscant system and Coruscant: Docking Bay (Dark); 'CCDB' Cloud City: East Platform (Docking Bay); 'Iggy w/ gun' IG-88 With Riot Gun; '4-LOM w/ gun' 4-LOM With Concussion Rifle; 'Boba Fett w/ gun' Boba Fett With Blaster Rifle; 'Dengar w/ gun' Dengar With Blaster Carbine; 'ZiMH' Zuckuss In Mist Hunter; 'BiHT' Bossk In Hound's Tooth.",
